<title>USA: Caldwell, N.J., won by Prudential Securities.</title>
<headline>Caldwell, N.J., won by Prudential Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities, Inc said it won $7.185 million of Caldwell, N.J., various general obligation bonds, with a lowest rate of 5.15, highest price of 100.066187.</p>
